@title Issues: the row of a chosen problem has a soft highlight, in dark, Light and Reduce motion (run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=hold; still under the harness)
@area Reports
@sizes 1366x768
# 1366x768 only: the steps pin the Issues panel with a fixed click on its pin icon. Open Issues from the status pill, pin the panel (an unpinned panel closes on a click), choose a problem (dark), switch to Light and choose another, then tick Reduce motion and choose a third: no fill. With KOPERCAD_MOTION=hold the highlight is frozen at 0.05 s; under the harness default none is drawn.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text "8 warnings"
wait 10
click 233 69
wait 5
shot list
click 120 220
wait 10
shot chosen-dark
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
click 120 300
wait 10
shot chosen-light
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
scroll 683 400 -3000
wait 6
click_text "Reduce motion"
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
click 120 400
wait 10
shot chosen-reduced
check_layout
